 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SCARECROW_PROMOTION_HELP','+1 Sight and +15% Combat Strength in native friendly territory, including qualifying Open Borders. Native melee combat uses the battle tile. Promotion persists through upgrades.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SCARECROW_DUMMY','Internal Assembly of Scarecrows yields'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SCARECROW_DUMMY_HELP','Invisible recurring city yield controller. Cannot be constructed or purchased.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SCARECROW_GREETING_1','Mind the seedlings, traveler. Every field has its watcher.'),
